<h1>Which US Credit Cards Transfer to Cathay Pacific Asia Miles? Warning for Chase Cardholders</h1>
<p class="lead">Many travel guides assume that "all flexible credit card points transfer to airline miles," but when it comes to Cathay Pacific Asia Miles, the credit card you hold dictates your options—especially if you are a Chase cardholder.</p>

<div class="callout warn">
  <strong>A Common Misconception:</strong> Chase Ultimate Rewards <strong>cannot</strong> be directly transferred to Asia Miles. Chase's airline transfer partners include British Airways Avios, United Airlines, Singapore Airlines, Air France/KLM Flying Blue, and Southwest Airlines, but Cathay Pacific is noticeably absent from this list.
</div>

<h2>Credit Cards That Directly Transfer to Asia Miles</h2>
<table>
  <tr><th>Credit Card Currency</th><th>Transfer Ratio</th><th>Notes</th></tr>
  <tr><td>Citi ThankYou Points</td><td>1 : 1</td><td>No loss in value, fast transfer</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Capital One Miles</td><td>1 : 1</td><td>No loss in value</td></tr>
